from lesson_helpers import example as ex
DATA={
'sha':'5d59757976e06573ada406898275c479829a2000','colour':'#188261','first':'ThresholdLatchReset',
'subtitle':('从检测判据到物理动作与独立反馈：学习完整保护链','From detection criteria to physical action and independent feedback: learn the complete protection chain'),
'intro':[
('ProtectionLibrary 用可组合元件表达保护链的不同职责：判据识别危险，表决处理多通道信息，协调逻辑决定命令权限，物理措施改变本体网络，独立反馈判断动作是否真正发生。它不是一个接上就能证明系统安全的黑箱。','ProtectionLibrary separates the responsibilities of a protection chain: criteria identify conditions, voting handles channels, coordination selects authority, physical measures alter the plant, and independent feedback checks whether an action occurred. It is not a black box that proves a system safe merely by being connected.'),
('本指南先讲清各层的接口与语义，再用九个案例学习迟滞、持续时间、锁存复位、表决资格、电气泄能、机械制动、热冷却和流体隔离。所有示例只需本库及 MSL 4.0.0。','This guide explains layer interfaces and semantics before using nine examples to study hysteresis, persistence, latching and reset, qualified voting, electrical energy dissipation, braking, cooling and fluid isolation. The examples require only this library and MSL 4.0.0.')],
'route':[
('先运行 ThresholdLatchReset，沿输入、原始判据、持续确认、锁存、复位许可顺序读曲线。','Run ThresholdLatchReset and follow input, raw criterion, persistence, latch and reset permission.'),
('分别学习布尔表决和模拟量融合，始终同时观察资格状态。','Study Boolean voting and analogue fusion separately, always inspecting qualification.'),
('运行一个物理域案例，分清控制命令、实际物理通路和残余响应。','Run one physical-domain example and distinguish command, physical path and residual response.'),
('最后运行 ActionFeedbackAndFailure，把动作确认纳入自己的闭环实验。','Finish with ActionFeedbackAndFailure and include action confirmation in your own closed-loop experiment.')],
'concepts':[
(('保护链中的每一层都要可观察','Observe every layer of the protection chain'),'建议至少保留原始测量、判据请求、表决结果、所选命令、执行状态和本体响应。request=true 只能说明逻辑发出请求，不能说明电源已断开、转子已停止或温度已安全。','Preserve raw measurement, criterion request, vote, selected command, actuator state and plant response. request=true means a request was issued, not that power was disconnected, a rotor stopped or temperature became safe.'),
(('迟滞与持续确认解决不同问题','Hysteresis and persistence solve different problems'),'HighLimit 的 tripLevel 与 resetLevel 定义进入和退出判据的边界；Persistence 的 holdTime 要求一次连续成立。迟滞防止边界附近反复切换，驻留防止过短事件立即触发；不能把两者理解成同一个延时。','HighLimit uses tripLevel and resetLevel for separate entry and exit boundaries. Persistence requires an uninterrupted holdTime. Hysteresis suppresses threshold chatter, while dwell rejects short events; they are not the same delay.'),
(('安全复位不是危险消失就自动解除','Safe reset is not automatic release'),'TripLatch 保留请求，直到获得允许的 reset 上升沿；同时存在 trip 与 reset 时跳闸优先。ResetPermission 可以要求危险消失并持续安全一段时间。把 reset 永久置真不等同于每次都提供新的复位沿。','TripLatch retains a request until a permitted rising reset edge is accepted; trip has priority over a simultaneous reset. ResetPermission can require continuous safe dwell. A permanently true reset is not a fresh reset edge on every occasion.'),
(('有效通道数与表决结果是两个输出','Valid-channel count and vote are separate outputs'),'布尔表决按 invalidVote 处理无效通道；enoughValid 是诊断输出，不会自动关闭 y。模拟量融合的 fallbackValue 可能是可绘制的实数，但 available=false 时不能把它当成有效测量。','Boolean voters use invalidVote for unqualified channels. enoughValid is diagnostic and does not automatically suppress y. Analogue fallbackValue remains a plottable number, but it is not a qualified measurement when available=false.'),
(('动作确认需要独立反馈','Action confirmation requires independent feedback'),'ActionMonitor 的 measuredAction 应来自实际执行器状态或另建的测量路径。把 command 原样接回 measuredAction 会把命令当成成功证据，掩盖延迟与拒动。状态输出仍是模型内部的行为，不等于真实传感器已经验证。','Feed ActionMonitor.measuredAction from an actuator state or a separately modelled measurement path. Feeding command straight back would mistake a request for success and conceal delay or refusal. A model state is still not independently validated physical sensing.')],
'groups':[
('Criteria',('危险判据','Condition criteria'),'把实际测量接入 u 或专用信号输入，按需要启用 valid，设置门限、方向、采样或驻留时间，再把 request 交给后续协调。不要同时由多个模块强制同一物理状态。','Connect measurements to u or the dedicated inputs, enable validity where needed, configure thresholds, direction, sampling or dwell, and route request to coordination. Do not use several blocks to impose the same physical state.'),
('Voting.BooleanVoting',('布尔表决','Boolean voting'),'u[n] 是逐通道请求，valid[n] 是逐通道资格。选定 1oo2、2oo3 等固定结构或 MOutOfN；明确 invalidVote 和 minValid，再决定不足通道时系统应跳闸、降级还是拒绝启动。','u[n] carries channel requests and valid[n] their qualification. Select a fixed structure or MOutOfN, declare invalidVote and minValid, then explicitly define the insufficient-channel policy.'),
('Voting.AnalogVoting',('模拟量融合','Analogue fusion'),'只融合相同物理量、相同单位与对齐时刻的数据。根据离群点、噪声和权重假设选中位数、均值、截尾或加权融合，同时使用 y、available 和 nValid。','Fuse the same physical quantity in matching units at aligned times. Choose median, mean, trimmed or weighted fusion according to the assumptions, and use y, available and nValid together.'),
('Coordination',('请求与权限协调','Request and authority coordination'),'连接原始请求、启动条件、复位许可和正常/保护命令；明确紧急优先级、保持时间和恢复条件。动作监测的反馈必须独立于发出的命令。','Connect requests, start permissives, reset permission and normal/protective commands. Declare emergency priority, hold times and recovery conditions. Action-monitor feedback must be independent of the issued command.'),
('Electrical',('电气保护措施','Electrical measures'),'Disconnect 串入电路，DumpLoad 提供耗散通路，SourceTransfer 连接真实主备源；Limiter 类只限幅指令。配置 Ron、Goff 等有限参数，检查储能元件断开后的释放路径。','Insert Disconnect in series, use DumpLoad as a dissipative path, and connect real supply nodes to SourceTransfer. Limiter blocks affect commands only. Configure finite parameters and check energy-release paths after disconnection.'),
('Mechanics',('制动与行程保护','Braking and travel protection'),'区分速度/力矩指令限幅与实际机械制动。制动元件连接惯性负载的 flange，行程接触连接两个端口；检查速度、位移、作用力矩与耗散。','Distinguish command limitation from physical braking. Connect brakes to load flanges and travel contact between two ports. Inspect velocity, displacement, force or torque and dissipation.'),
('Thermal',('冷却与热保护','Cooling and thermal protection'),'冷却热导必须连接被保护节点与环境；CoolingEnable 按实现抽取有限热功率。TemperatureDerating 和 HeatInputLimiter 只输出命令，必须再驱动本体热源或设备。','A cooling conductance must connect the protected node to an environment; CoolingEnable extracts finite heat power. TemperatureDerating and HeatInputLimiter produce commands that must drive the host source or device.'),
('Fluid',('隔离、旁通与泄压','Isolation, bypass and relief'),'配置一致 Medium、动态容腔及环境边界。IsolationValve 连接主供流路径，ReliefValve 接在容腔与环境之间的独立支路；FlowLimiter 只是质量流量指令限幅。','Use a consistent Medium, appropriate storage and boundaries. Put IsolationValve in the supply path and ReliefValve on an independent chamber-to-environment branch. FlowLimiter limits a mass-flow command only.')],
'examples':{
'ThresholdLatchReset':ex(('门限确认、锁存和安全复位','Threshold qualification, latch and safe reset'),('短时越限与持续危险如何形成锁存保护？','How do short and sustained conditions produce a latched trip?'),('signal 在 12 与 7 间切换。HighLimit 使用 10/8 的进入与复位门限，Persistence 驻留 0.2 s，ResetPermission 安全等待 0.25 s；复位脉冲在 1.2 和 3.4 s。','signal switches between 12 and 7. HighLimit uses 10/8 trip/reset thresholds, Persistence requires 0.2 s and ResetPermission requires 0.25 s safe dwell. Reset pulses occur at 1.2 and 3.4 s.'),('初始化即越限，持续确认后形成锁存。1.2 s 的复位不应覆盖同时满足的跳闸；危险在 3 s 后解除并完成安全驻留，3.4 s 的复位才可解除。逐层比较请求而不是只看最后一个布尔量。','The condition is high initially and latches after qualification. Reset at 1.2 s must not override a qualified trip. After danger clears at 3 s and safe dwell completes, the 3.4 s reset can release the latch. Inspect intermediate requests, not only the final Boolean.'),['signal.y','limit.request','persist.request','safeDwell.resetAllowed','reset.y','protectedState'],('把 persist.holdTime 调至 0.5，使初始 0.35 s 高值脉冲不足以确认，再比较初始锁存。','Set persist.holdTime to 0.5 so that the initial 0.35 s high pulse is insufficient; compare the initial latch behaviour.'),('该案例说明逻辑时序，不包含执行器或真实设备停机时间。','This establishes a logic sequence, not actuator or equipment shutdown time.')),
'BooleanVoting':ex(('固定表决结构与无效通道策略','Fixed votes and invalid-channel policy'),('相同输入为何会因资格策略产生不同表决？','Why do identical values produce different votes under different qualification policies?'),('VotePattern 产生五路请求与资格。固定表决器采用 invalidVote=true，自定义 MOutOfN 使用 n=3、m=2、invalidVote=false。','VotePattern supplies five requests and qualifications. Fixed voters use invalidVote=true; MOutOfN uses n=3, m=2 and invalidVote=false.'),('0–1 s 前三路为 true,false,true，2oo3 为真；1–2 s 请求全假。3 s 后全部通道无效，固定表决器会按“无效算请求”产生真值，而 MOutOfN 可为假；两者都必须结合 nValid=0 解释。','Before 1 s the first three votes are true,false,true, so 2oo3 is true; all requests are false over 1–2 s. After 3 s all channels are invalid: fixed voters count invalid channels as requests while MOutOfN does not. Both must be interpreted with nValid=0.'),['twoOutOfThreeRequest','mOutOfNRequest','twoOutOfThree.nValid','twoOutOfThree.enoughValid','twoOutOfThree.degraded'],('令 MOutOfN.invalidVote=true，与固定 2oo3 对照；再单独修改 minValid，确认它对诊断与 y 的不同影响。','Set MOutOfN.invalidVote=true and compare it with fixed 2oo3; then vary minValid separately and distinguish its diagnostic effect from y.'),('表决结构不直接给出诊断覆盖率、失效概率或安全完整性等级。','The vote structure does not establish diagnostic coverage, failure probability or a safety integrity level.')),
'AnalogVoting':ex(('离群值与逐步丢失通道','Outliers and progressive channel loss'),('中位数与均值在离群值和资格下降时怎样变化？','How do median and mean respond to an outlier and decreasing qualification?'),('三路为 {1,1.1,10}，五路为 {1,1.1,1.2,1.3,10}；1 s 后排除大离群值，随后进一步失去资格。各融合器的后备值为 -9。','Three inputs are {1,1.1,10}; five are {1,1.1,1.2,1.3,10}. The large outlier is excluded after 1 s, followed by further qualification loss. Fallback is -9.'),('初始三路中位数为 1.1，均值约 4.0333；五路中位数 1.2，均值 2.92。排除离群值后结果靠近小量值群；资格不足后出现 -9，同时 available=false。','Initially the three-channel median is 1.1 and mean approximately 4.0333; the five-channel median is 1.2 and mean 2.92. Excluding the outlier brings results towards the small-value cluster; insufficient qualification yields -9 with available=false.'),['median3Value','mean3Value','median5Value','mean5Value','median3.available','median3.nValid'],('修改 fallbackValue 或选择源码提供的 HoldLast 策略；始终同步查看 available。','Change fallbackValue or select the declared HoldLast policy; always inspect available alongside the numerical output.'),('中位数并不自动识别所有共因故障；多个通道一致偏移时也可能输出看似正常的一致值。','A median does not automatically diagnose common-cause failure; consistently biased channels can produce a plausible fused value.')),
'CommandPriorityAndInterlock':ex(('权限选择与启动联锁','Authority selection and start interlocking'),('紧急请求、保护请求和降级请求同时存在时选谁？','Which command wins when emergency, protection and degraded requests overlap?'),('四种命令值依次为 1、0.6、0、-1；降级从 1 s 开始，保护在 [2,4) s，紧急在 [3,3.5) s。启动联锁合并两条许可，恢复再等待 0.2 s。','Command levels are 1, 0.6, 0 and -1. Degraded mode begins at 1 s, protection spans [2,4) s, and emergency spans [3,3.5) s. Start interlocking combines two permissives and adds a 0.2 s return delay.'),('selectedCommand 应按正常、降级、保护、紧急、保护、降级的顺序变化。许可恢复不等于启动输出立刻恢复；观察 release 的确认时间。','selectedCommand follows normal, degraded, protection, emergency, protection and degraded authority. Restored permissives do not imply immediate start output; inspect the release qualification delay.'),['selectedCommand','selectCommand.selectedSource','interlock.startPermitted','startAllowed'],('改变 release.onDelay，观察启动允许的恢复时刻；不要修改权限优先级来模拟执行器延迟。','Vary release.onDelay and inspect the return of start permission; do not change authority priority to represent actuator delay.'),('输出是选择后的命令和许可，尚未证明本体实际进入相应状态。','The outputs are selected commands and permissions, not evidence that the plant reached those states.')),
'ElectricalTripAndDump':ex(('电路断开与电感泄能','Disconnection and inductive-energy dissipation'),('为什么断电后还需要单独的泄能通路？','Why is a separate energy-release path needed after disconnection?'),('1 s 时两个 12 V 回路断开。纯电阻回路只考察开关；另一个回路含 0.1 H 电感和 R=10 Ω 的受控 DumpLoad。','At 1 s two 12 V circuits disconnect. One is resistive; the other includes a 0.1 H inductor and a controlled 10-ohm DumpLoad.'),('纯电阻电流显著下降但有限 Goff 允许残余泄漏；电感电流不能无代价瞬时消失，dump.lossPower 表示其耗散路径。','Resistive current drops strongly, with finite Goff allowing residual leakage. Inductor current cannot disappear instantaneously without energy transfer; dump.lossPower exposes its dissipative path.'),['resistiveLoad.i','inductiveSwitch.isOpen','coil.i','dump.lossPower'],('改变 dump.R 并比较电感衰减与峰值电压；在副本中谨慎研究没有泄能通路的模型，检查诊断而非直接接受尖峰。','Vary dump.R and compare current decay and peak voltage. A separate no-dump experiment requires careful diagnostic inspection rather than accepting every spike.'),('开关 isOpen 是其建模状态，不等同于独立测得的触点位置。','isOpen is the modelled switch state, not an independent contact-position measurement.')),
'MechanicalBraking':ex(('有限黏性制动','Finite viscous braking'),('保护动作如何通过实际力矩或力降低动能？','How does a protective force or torque reduce kinetic energy?'),('初速均为 10 的转动和平动惯性负载连接 d=2 的制动器，制动请求在 [1,4) s 有效。','Rotational and translational inertial loads start at speed 10 and connect to d=2 brakes. The request is active over [1,4) s.'),('动作后速度逐渐降低而不是强制归零。若未触及限制且参数为 J=m=1，理想黏性近似具有 0.5 s 时间常数；实际以模型限幅与残余参数为准。','Speeds decrease continuously rather than being forced to zero. With J=m=1 and no limiting, the viscous approximation has a 0.5 s time constant; the actual implementation also includes its declared limits and residual parameters.'),['rotationBody.w','translationBody.v','rotationBrake.lossPower','translationBrake.lossPower'],('加大 d 或缩短动作窗口，比较停止接近程度和耗散速度。','Increase d or shorten the active window and compare residual speed and dissipation rate.'),('纯黏性模型不能据此证明真实静摩擦驻车能力。','A viscous model does not establish real static holding capability.')),
'ThermalCooling':ex(('同热负荷下的保护冷却','Protective cooling under the same heat load'),('冷却命令如何改变真实热响应？','How does a cooling command alter the physical thermal response?'),('两套热容 C=100、热源 100 W、环境 300 K 相同。保护支路温度超过 316 K 后把热导由 1 增到 10 W/K，复位阈值 307 K；另有一个独立热指令限幅演示。','Both branches have C=100, 100 W input and 300 K ambient. The protected conductance rises from 1 to 10 W/K above 316 K, with reset at 307 K. A separate branch demonstrates heat-command limiting.'),('参考支路趋向较高温度；保护支路开启更强冷却后温升受抑。不要误以为独立的 limitCommand.y 已经改变了 FixedHeatFlow 的 100 W 热源。','The reference tends towards a higher temperature; stronger cooling limits the protected response. The separate limitCommand.y does not modify the 100 W FixedHeatFlow source in this wiring.'),['protectedBody.T','referenceBody.T','hot.request','protectedCooling.heatFlow','limitCommand.y'],('改变 Gon 或 tripLevel，分别比较冷却能力与触发时机的影响。','Vary Gon or tripLevel separately to distinguish cooling capacity from detection timing.'),('降额指令只有接入本体功率路径后才能改变产热。','A derating command changes heat generation only when connected to the plant power path.')),
'FluidIsolationAndRelief':ex(('压缩容腔的隔离与独立泄压','Isolation and independent relief of a compressible vessel'),('切断来流和开启泄压分别改变什么？','How do inlet isolation and relief affect the vessel differently?'),('保护与参考容腔采用 DryAirNasa、V=0.005 m³。保护侧有独立环境泄压支路；阀的开启/关闭压差为 100/80 kPa，8 s 后请求隔离。','Protected and reference vessels use DryAirNasa and V=0.005 m³. The protected vessel has an independent relief branch with 100/80 kPa differential thresholds; isolation is requested after 8 s.'),('比较两容腔绝对压力、泄压流量与隔离开度。100 kPa 的开启阈值是压差，不能误当成 100 kPa 绝对压力；有限开度时间与泄漏影响瞬态。','Compare absolute vessel pressures, relief mass flow and isolation opening. The 100 kPa threshold is a pressure difference, not an absolute pressure. Finite opening time and leakage affect the transient.'),['protectedVolume.medium.p','referenceVolume.medium.p','relief.massFlow','isolation.opening'],('分别改变 openPressure 和 openingTime，观察触发点与执行动态，不要一次同时改变供压。','Vary openPressure and openingTime separately to distinguish the trigger from actuation dynamics, keeping supply pressure fixed.'),('泄压支路必须实际连接容腔与环境；仅生成布尔请求不能移走质量。','Relief must physically connect vessel and environment; a Boolean request alone removes no mass.')),
'ActionFeedbackAndFailure':ex(('相同请求下的成功动作与拒动','Successful and refused actions under the same request'),('如何证明保护命令发出后实际得到执行？','How can execution be distinguished from issuing a command?'),('1 s 时发出相同命令。良好执行器为 T=0.05 s 一阶环节；另一支路通过 permit=false 拒绝输入。测得输出达到 0.9 才视为动作，监测超时 0.2 s。','Identical commands start at 1 s. The good actuator has T=0.05 s; the other input is refused by permit=false. Action is measured when output reaches 0.9, with a 0.2 s timeout.'),('良好执行器达到 90% 的解析时延约 0.05 ln(10)=0.1151 s，小于超时；拒动支路保持零并在约 1.2 s 失败。分别读 acknowledged、failed 与 actionTime。','The analytical 90% delay is approximately 0.05 ln(10)=0.1151 s, below the timeout. The refused branch stays at zero and fails at approximately 1.2 s. Inspect acknowledged, failed and actionTime separately.'),['goodActuator.y','refusedActuator.y','goodMonitor.acknowledged','goodMonitor.actionTime','refusedMonitor.failed','refusedMonitor.failureCount'],('把 goodActuator.T 改为 0.2，观察迟到动作与及时确认的区别。','Set goodActuator.T to 0.2 and distinguish late action from timely acknowledgement.'),('该案例的反馈来自执行器模型状态，实际工程还需传感器资格、测量延迟与故障假设。','Feedback here comes from an actuator model state; engineering studies may also require sensor qualification, measurement delay and sensor-failure assumptions.'))
},
'study':[
('按“测量→判据→持续确认→锁存/权限→执行器→独立反馈”的顺序装配，逐层确认信号含义。先只接逻辑，完成边界时刻测试，再连接实际物理措施。每增加一层都保留中间输出。','Assemble measurement, criterion, persistence, latch/authority, actuator and independent feedback in that order. First test logic and boundary timing, then connect physical measures. Preserve intermediate outputs at every stage.'),
('下面是最小的门限加锁存实验。resetAllowed 在教学中固定为真，故它不代表完整安全复位设计；正式模型应使用 ResetPermission 并接入实际许可条件。','The minimal threshold-and-latch experiment below fixes resetAllowed to true for teaching. It is not a complete safe-reset design; a real study should use ResetPermission and actual permissives.')],
'snippet':'''within;
model MyTripStudy
  Modelica.Blocks.Sources.RealExpression measurement(y=if time<1 then 7 else 12);
  Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanConstant noReset(k=false);
  Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanConstant permit(k=true);
  ProtectionLibrary.Criteria.HighLimit high(tripLevel=10, resetLevel=8);
  ProtectionLibrary.Criteria.Persistence qualified(holdTime=0.2);
  ProtectionLibrary.Coordination.TripLatch latch;
equation
  connect(measurement.y, high.u);
  connect(high.request, qualified.u);
  connect(qualified.request, latch.trip);
  connect(noReset.y, latch.reset);
  connect(permit.y, latch.resetAllowed);
  annotation(experiment(StopTime=3, Tolerance=1e-6));
end MyTripStudy;''',
 'trouble':[
(('所有通道无效时为何表决为真','Why is the vote true with no valid channels?'),'先看 invalidVote。默认把无效通道当作请求，可能是一种失效安全策略；enoughValid 不会自动抑制 y。必须在系统层说明这种策略的预期后果。','Inspect invalidVote. Counting invalid channels as requests can be an intentional fail-safe policy; enoughValid does not inhibit y automatically. Explain the resulting system-level behaviour.'),
(('复位为什么无效','Why was reset rejected?'),'检查 trip 是否仍为真、resetAllowed 是否为真，以及 reset 是否确实出现新的上升沿。只把测量值降回门限附近可能尚未满足迟滞和连续安全驻留。','Check whether trip remains true, resetAllowed is true and a new rising reset edge occurred. Returning a measurement near its threshold may not satisfy hysteresis or continuous safe dwell.'),
(('已断开但仍有残余电流或流量','Why does flow remain after isolation?'),'物理元件保留有限 Goff、泄漏或残余导通，模型可能有储能。把残余量和参数对应起来，不要简单把非零输出判为实现错误。','Finite off-conductance, leakage, residual transmission and stored energy can remain. Relate the residual to the declared parameters rather than treating every non-zero value as an implementation error.'),
(('保护成功能否等价于系统安全','Does successful protection prove safety?'),'不能。应同时检查保护动作、残余响应、其他安全目标以及保护造成的副作用。示例不构成认证，也不提供概率可靠性结论。','No. Inspect the action, residual response, other safety objectives and adverse effects of protection. The examples are not certification or probabilistic reliability evidence.')]
}
